Tracked rules: contrib/logging/conversion/rules/port-mapping.json
Rules SHA256: e4e515dae976cef190688b90a0d2569e7721a8abf21b72188f84950db90c5901
Input scope: src/common/pcp.cpp, src/mapport.cpp
Prerequisite tool commit: 43d5848cf66d39fa34b84890f59d2fad087f3615
